        {
          "text": "Hakadiye utendelela nzambi wandi Niseloka mu nsubu wandi, Adelameleke ne Shalese bakamushiha ne muele wa nvita; bakanyemena mu buloba bua Alalata. Esâ-hadona, muanʼandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
